  "source": "",
  "lolo": "app std-fx-particles \"1.1.0\"\n\"Headless transient-fx mechanic serving BOTH game boards and learning shells: appends spawned particles on BURST — stamping maxTtl (fade envelope) and bornAt (epoch ms, smooth render interpolation) when absent — decays each entry's ttl every tick, drops the dead ones, and clears on RESTART. Name-blind mechanism: the effect-kind vocabulary is consumer-declared (FxPreset tables at the render call sites). Composed onto a [runtime, shared] entity; renders nothing — the board/shell owns the single render authority (draw-fx-layer for space \\\"world\\\", fx-overlay for space \\\"screen\\\"). Corresponds to the design-sheet field(s): feedback, rewards.\"\norbital FxParticlesOrbital {\n  type Fx = {\n    id : string!\n    type : string!\n    x : number!\n    z : number\n    y : number\n    message : string\n    ttl : number!\n    maxTtl : number\n    bornAt : number\n    space : string\n    effect : string\n    color : string\n    size : number\n    vx : number\n    vy : number\n    vz : number\n    particleCount : number\n    animation : string\n  }\n\n  entity FxState [runtime, shared] {\n    id : string!\n    fx : [Fx] = []\n  }\n\n  trait FxParticles -> @rebindable FxState [lifecycle] {\n    initial: active\n\n    state active {\n      INIT -> active\n        (set @entity.fx (array/map @config.fx (fn p (object/merge @p {\n          maxTtl: (if (object/get @p maxTtl) (object/get @p maxTtl) (object/get @p ttl))\n          bornAt: (if (object/get @p bornAt) (object/get @p bornAt) (time/now))\n        }))))\n      BURST -> active\n        (set @entity.fx (array/concat @entity.fx (array/map @payload.particles (fn p (object/merge @p {\n          maxTtl: (if (object/get @p maxTtl) (object/get @p maxTtl) (object/get @p ttl))\n          bornAt: (if (object/get @p bornAt) (object/get @p bornAt) (time/now))\n        })))))\n      RESTART -> active\n        (set @entity.fx [])\n    }\n\n    ticks {\n      fxTick every 500ms\n        when (and @config.running (> (array/len @entity.fx) 0))\n        (set @entity.fx (array/filter\n          (array/map @entity.fx (fn e (object/merge @e { ttl: (- (object/get @e ttl) @config.decayRate) })))\n          (fn e (> (object/get @e ttl) 0))))\n    }\n\n    listens {\n      BURST { particles : [Fx] }\n      RESTART { }\n    }\n\n    config {\n      decayRate : number = 1\n        @label \"Decay Rate\"\n        @description \"Ttl units removed from every fx entry each tick; higher fades particles faster.\"\n        @tier \"domain\"\n      running : boolean = true\n        @label \"Running\"\n        @description \"When true the decay tick runs; toggle to freeze effects.\"\n        @tier \"domain\"\n      fx : [Fx] = []\n        @label \"Initial Fx\"\n        @description \"Seed particles rendered before the first BURST; usually empty.\"\n        @tier \"domain\"\n    }\n  }\n\n  page \"/fx-particles\" as FxParticlesPage -> FxParticles\n}\n"
}